sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Engine (sync, in a DB session)
  participant DB as events table
  participant H as after_commit hook
  participant Q as Subscriber queues (bounded)
  participant WS as WebSocket clients
  E->>DB: INSERT event (same transaction as the state change)
  E->>E: COMMIT
  DB-->>H: commit succeeded
  H->>Q: put_nowait(event) - oldest dropped if full
  Q->>WS: send_json
  Note over E,H: a rollback discards the pending events
